  "irisLeftPrompt": "Use case: precise-object-edit. Asset: isolated anime Live2D iris only. Image 1 is existing painting to locally repair; image 2 is same-size original visible iris reference with non-iris areas neutral gray; image 3 is control: red visible own paint, yellow completion, green outside transparent. Preserve exact tall oval ratio, tilt, blue gradient, dark narrow pupil and cyan bottom shape from original image 2. Repair full outer rim as a clean continuous fine dark navy line, especially lower edge, with no fringes or isolated speckles. Match original layered cyan patches rather than adding a new crescent. Complete the small yellow holes with intrinsic iris painting only. No white highlights, no glow, no reflections baked in, no sclera or eyelash or skin pixels: highlights are a separate Live2D layer. All green region genuinely transparent. Keep existing interior painterly soft shading; preserve composition and proportions, no squashing.",
